# Hosts of the streaming services whose automation never goes into a public
# repo (CLAUDE.md, ADR-017, ADR-066). bin/agentv-check fails on any of these
# in a file AgenTV adds. Perl regular expressions, matched without regard to
# case.
#
# "#@ <id>" starts a service's lines. In agentv-apps only, the app in that
# service's own folder (service-folders) may use them. Every other repo has
# no service-folders, so there they're refused everywhere. Spotify comes
# first, under no heading: it's agent-built only and never in a repo.

spotify\.com
spotifycdn\.com
scdn\.co

